1
00:00:00,848 --> 00:00:02,718
(Raj:)it's the guy who
shows me YouTube videos

2
00:00:02,716 --> 00:00:05,546
(Raj:)of people getting hit
in the nuts.

3
00:00:07,287 --> 00:00:08,787
(Howard:)You're crazy.

4
00:00:08,789 --> 00:00:09,919
(Howard:)I've worked with Hawking.

5
00:00:09,923 --> 00:00:11,253
He's got a great sense of humor.

6
00:00:11,258 --> 00:00:12,228
(Howard:)And I think he'd like it.

7
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:14,226
(Bernadette:)Okay, call him and show him.

8
00:00:14,228 --> 00:00:15,698
(Bernadette:)I dare you.

9
00:00:15,696 --> 00:00:17,926
(Howard:)I have no problem calling him.

10
00:00:17,931 --> 00:00:19,201
(Bernadette:)Fine, then do it.

11
00:00:19,199 --> 00:00:20,729
(Howard:)Fine, I will.

12
00:00:22,369 --> 00:00:26,039
(Bernadette:)While you're bothering the
world's most famous scientist,

13
00:00:26,039 --> 00:00:27,639
(Bernadette:)be sure to show him
how funny he looks

14
00:00:27,641 --> 00:00:29,841
(Bernadette:)getting stuck
under our dishwasher.

15
00:00:31,578 --> 00:00:33,078
(Raj:)What's this button do?

16
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:36,480
(Remote-control Hawking:)Gentlemen,
start your wheelchairs.

17
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:42,590
(Howard:)You laughed when that guy
got hit in the nuts.

18
00:00:45,259 --> 00:00:48,229
(Raj:)I laughed because
the guy was Leonard.

19
00:00:50,998 --> 00:00:53,768
(Sheldon:)I admire you, Leonard.

20
00:00:53,767 --> 00:00:56,067
(Leonard:)Really, why?

21
00:00:56,069 --> 00:00:58,139
(Sheldon:)You're happy with who you are.

22
00:00:58,138 --> 00:01:00,668
(Sheldon:)You don't get jealous
of other people.

